1
00:00:00,846 --> 00:00:04,616
(Raj:)And you know what will be on
that elephant's back? A seat warmer.

2
00:00:06,218 --> 00:00:09,378
"No, Father, you may not have a ride!"

3
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,620
(Bernadette:)I'm gonna make some coffee.

4
00:00:15,227 --> 00:00:17,097
So who do you schmooze
to get this deal?

5
00:00:17,296 --> 00:00:20,736
(Leonard:)I'm not gonna schmooze anybody.
I'm gonna let my work speak for itself.

6
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,240
- That's great. That shows a lot of integrity.
- Thank you.

7
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,800
(Leonard:)I'm a naive idiot, right?

8
00:00:28,373 --> 00:00:29,963
(Penny:)Oh, good, you heard me.

9
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:34,980
(Amy:)If you really want tenure,
cozy up to the people making the decision.

10
00:00:35,414 --> 00:00:37,974
(Sheldon:)Sheldon Cooper does not do cozy.

11
00:00:38,817 --> 00:00:40,647
(Amy:)You don't say.

12
00:00:42,154 --> 00:00:45,214
(Sheldon:)But I suppose it wouldn't hurt
to know who's on the committee.

13
00:00:45,424 --> 00:00:49,484
Let's see. Janine Davis. Oh, dear.

14
00:00:50,162 --> 00:00:53,032
- Is that a problem?
- Well...

15
00:00:53,231 --> 00:00:59,021
(Sheldon:)Even you. You're a slave.

